    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Fire Shadows + People: The Last Bullet&quot; is a VR experience with perspective shifts, wrapped in cinematic action, bullet time, and psychological noir.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old school classics, this game blends slow-motion gunfights with heavy atmosphere and narrative depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone detective caught between memory, violence, and shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642920/extras/c268d9428611eecc911bffb5eb5aef3c.avif?t=1744413759\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow down time</strong> and dive through bullets in intense action sequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642920/extras/8897f3fd972f19c4cf602e84012e0fcf.avif?t=1744413759\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch between first and third-person</strong> viewpoints for a unique narrative blend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover hidden truths</strong> in a dark world where nothing is as it seems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narration-driven storytelling</strong> pulls you deeper into a haunting atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642920/extras/cd799f941c472a5346a6bf6e1f60eae7.avif?t=1744413759\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a VR shooter.<br>This is a fragmented story\u2014told one bullet at a time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Fire Shadows + People: The Last Bullet&quot; is a VR experience with perspective shifts, wrapped in cinematic action, bullet time, and psychological noir.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old school classics, this game blends slow-motion gunfights with heavy atmosphere and narrative depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone detective caught between memory, violence, and shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642920/extras/c268d9428611eecc911bffb5eb5aef3c.avif?t=1744413759\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow down time</strong> and dive through bullets in intense action sequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642920/extras/8897f3fd972f19c4cf602e84012e0fcf.avif?t=1744413759\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch between first and third-person</strong> viewpoints for a unique narrative blend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover hidden truths</strong> in a dark world where nothing is as it seems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narration-driven storytelling</strong> pulls you deeper into a haunting atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642920/extras/cd799f941c472a5346a6bf6e1f60eae7.avif?t=1744413759\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a VR shooter.<br>This is a fragmented story\u2014told one bullet at a time.</p>",
